msgstr "Privatlivsaftale for vejrtjenester"

#: src/anduinos-appearance:362
msgid ""
"1. Approximate location (ipapi.co)\n"
"AnduinOS will make one HTTPS request to ipapi.co. Its operator, Kloudend, Inc., will see your public IP address and may use it to estimate your city, country, and approximate coordinates.\n"
"\n"
"2. Weather data (Open-Meteo)\n"
"The weather extension will send the selected approximate coordinates to Open-Meteo, operated by OpenMeteo GmbH. The service will also see your public IP address and may retain API logs for up to 90 days.\n"
"\n"
"AnduinOS is not affiliated with, sponsored by, or endorsed by either third-party service. If location detection fails, AnduinOS will use an offline estimate based on your system timezone.\n"
"\n"
"Privacy policies:\n"
"https://ipapi.co/privacy/\n"
"https://open-meteo.com/en/terms"
msgstr ""
"1. Omtrentlig placering (ipapi.co)\n"
"AnduinOS foretager én HTTPS-anmodning til ipapi.co. Operatøren, Kloudend, Inc., kan se din offentlige IP-adresse og bruge den til at anslå din by, dit land og dine omtrentlige koordinater.\n"
"\n"
"2. Vejrdata (Open-Meteo)\n"
"Vejrudvidelsen sender de valgte omtrentlige koordinater til Open-Meteo, som drives af OpenMeteo GmbH. Tjenesten kan også se din offentlige IP-adresse og gemme API-logfiler i op til 90 dage.\n"
"\n"
"AnduinOS er hverken tilknyttet, sponsoreret eller godkendt af nogen af de to tredjepartstjenester. Hvis positionsbestemmelsen mislykkes, bruger AnduinOS et offlineestimat baseret på systemets tidszone.\n"
"\n"
"Privatlivspolitikker:\n"
"https://ipapi.co/privacy/\n"
"https://open-meteo.com/en/terms"

